    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d124">

                <pb facs="0278" n="146" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg146"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 EW/7–545:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 124 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-05T10:00:00-04:00">July 5, 1945—10
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1521. I should like to invite you to be present at the forthcoming meeting of the
                    three Heads of Government. Page should
                    accompany you. State Department party expects to arrive in Berlin July 13.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
